+# Audit: the Conversation pattern (0.23.0)
+
+Date: 2026-11-03 · PR: Cochilo 0.29.0 · Auditor: Claude (graphic-design-fundamentals + impeccable)
+
+## Scope
+
+A composition of existing roles (`selected`, `on-selected`, `surface`, `line`, `muted`, `ink`)
+for Cochilo's Ask screen. No tokens.
+
+## graphic-design-fundamentals (§13 checklist)
+
+| # | Question | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Brief | Pass: a calm answer, her numbers first |
+| 2 | Concept | Pass: her words in blush, Cochilo's in a plain card |
+| 3 | Hierarchy | Pass: meta labels over body text, the source last |
+| 4 | Contrast | Pass: listed pairs only |
+| 5 | Alignment and grid | Pass: question right, answer full width |
+| 6 | Spacing | Pass: space6 between exchanges, space3 between an answer's parts |
+| 7 | Typography | Pass: body for answers, meta for labels |
+| 8 | Colour | Pass: no red or coral on health replies; teal only on Ask |
+| 9 | Consistency | Pass: filter chips, fields and cards from the kit |
+| 10 | Simplicity | Pass |
+| 11 | Real-size test | Pass: Cochilo `ask_light`, `ask_care_ptBR_dark`, `ask_not_sure_light` |
+| 12 | Accessibility and ergonomics | Pass: the answer card is a live region, merged for TalkBack |
+| 13 | Production | Pass |
+
+## impeccable (audit)
+
+| # | Dimension | Score | Key finding |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Accessibility | 4 | Live region; 48dp chips |
+| 2 | Performance | 4 | — |
+| 3 | Appearance & theming | 4 | Roles only, three themes |
+| 4 | Platform conformance | 4 | Chat layout conventions |
+| 5 | Adaptivity | 4 | Bubble width bounded by content-max |
+| | **Total** | **20/20** | |
